From the preview:

```json
{
  "resources": {
    "vehicle_positions": {
      "canonical": "/v3/positions",
      "deprecated_aliases": ["/v1/locations", "/v2/pings"]
    },
    "trip_history": {
      "canonical": "/v3/trips",
      "deprecated_aliases": ["/v1/journeys"],
      "not": "/v2/routes (planned routes)"
    },
    "sensor_frames": {
      "canonical": "/v3/sensor-frames",
      "deprecated_aliases": ["/v2/sensors"]
    },
    "geofence_events": {
      "canonical": "/v3/geofence-events",
      "not": "/v3/geofences (definitions)"
    }
  }
}
```

For `trip_history`:
- canonical path: `/v3/trips`
- The planned-routes path it's explicitly flagged against: `/v2/routes` (from the "not" field)

The "not" field says `/v2/routes (planned routes)` — so the excluded planned-routes path is `/v2/routes`.

